    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for not trying to fix me. it's rare to have someone actually hear that. but it's getting harder to stay \"present\" when nothing feels solid. it's like i'm just waiting for a signal to finally turn off. does it seem logical to you? like, if there's no real substance to my life, isn't it just more peaceful to stop fighting the current?",
